flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Set total to zero]
    B --> C[/Enter number of items/]
    C --> D[Repeat for each item: enter name, price, quantity]
    D --> E[Add price times quantity to total]
    E --> F{More items?}
    F -- Yes --> D
    F -- No --> G[/Display item details and total bill/]
    G --> H([Stop])
